@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra dich vu dang chay -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Nop bai hop le -> 201 Created
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "dtc245340007",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/nguyenthiquynhtho/EduSubmit-dtc245340007"
}

### 4. Nop bai thieu thong tin (studentCode rong) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/test"
}

### 5. Nop bai voi assignmentId <= 0 -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 0,
  "studentCode": "dtc245340007",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/test"
}

### 6. [Bai mo rong] Doc luot nop ton tai theo GUID (thay GUID that sau khi POST) -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 7. [Bai mo rong] Doc luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
